Sample MVR files (lighting/)
Public test files from https://github.com/open-stage/python-mvr (MIT, see
lighting/LICENSE-python-mvr.txt). capture_demo_show.mvr is a Capture export. small-club-rig.mvr and theatre-rig.mvr
